continuation_text:
 return to the Star Wars franchise for The Last Jedi. Here's the relevant passage:
"We were supposed to shoot The Last Jedi and they were reworking the script every day. And so, I was with Mark, my dear friend, and she was writing and I was doing it and it was all very, very, very enjoyable and I was having a great time, but then Mark did the same thing with the next film, and so now I’m back in it. We will find a way to make me look beautiful in the movie and I don’t care who we have to hire, okay?"
